# Deliberate settings, checked with Trivy and kept on purpose (one reason per finding).

# OpenShift's restricted-v2 SCC assigns a random UID/GID per namespace; pinning runAsUser/runAsGroup breaks it.
KSV-0020
KSV-0021
# No CPU limit on purpose: limits cause CFS throttling of the JVM; CPU requests are set for scheduling.
KSV-0011
# The chart is namespace-agnostic; the namespace comes from helm --namespace, never "default" in a stage.
KSV-0110
# ghcr.io (this repo's own registry) and quay.io/sclorg (Red Hat) are the intended registries.
KSV-0125
